{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2021-05-20 09:00:00', 'title': 'NIPSCO TO EXPLORE RANGE OF OPTIONS TO MEET FUTURE ELECTRIC NEEDS', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND., MAY 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORTHERN INDIANA PUBLIC SERVICE COMPANY, LLC (NIPSCO), A SUBSIDIARY OF NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI), HAS ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF ITS NEXT ROUND OF REQUEST FOR PROPOSALS (RFP) TO CONSIDER A COMBINATION OF POTENTIAL RESOURCES TO MEET THE FUTURE ELECTRIC NEEDS OF ITS CUSTOMERS.'}